t producer and companion exclusion[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]manifest-producer[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]manifest-producer: add the `!20*/**/*.diagrams.md` companion exclusion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the provider globs and ship the new `#research/diagrams` macro that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decides, draws, render-checks, anchors, writes, and registers a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`<stem>.diagrams.md` manifest and always sets the `diagrams` status [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]variable, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Swarm diagrams flag and linker placement[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]swarm-diagram-handoff[dim] · [dim][/dim]after manifest-producer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]swarm-diagram-handoff: add the nullable `diagrams` swarm input, run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`#research/diagrams` after `#research/image` in the image segment, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]teach the linker to read, bind before restructuring, place verbatim, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate, and report diagram proposals, with the render matrix tests and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1ml","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1ml.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fad8f45c12e63a98b76ab441ef83153c","started_at":"2026-10-18T15:54:51.714578+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.sase-1ml","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-1ml.1","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-1ml.2","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-1ml.land"]}
